TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:000C:0003:}}Bu da neydi böyle? Kim benim{{TAG:0007:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}
