{{TAG:0012:0016:00CD}},
{{TAG:0003:0021:}}das ist bekannt.{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

EN:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:000C:0002:}}You're still spouting that nonsense?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Well,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0003:0015:}}your lies are about to catch up
