IT:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:000C:0002:}}Ancora tutte queste fandonie?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Beh,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0003:0015:}}sarebbe ora che la facessi
